{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach and grab it, check properties and perform task. Or scan, move and detect object. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsWithinGrabRange    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsPathFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    />",
